 "notes": "A face is three objects an eye: a centred white (a pose scales it: squint), a pupil (actor eyes moves it; a pose only sizes it), a brow (a pose places and turns it). Build the poses in code (tools/polyvoid_build.py sq_pose) - one entry per object, 40 a pose, 8 poses an actor. The mood graph reacts to events: a hit (gap so it does not flicker), the hero hurt, a graze streak, a phase. Emotes: the hud shows pv_emote_<k> while emote == k and time < emote_until, at x(boss), z(boss)."
}